{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>Is it a small thing.</b> The matter is light, for you brought us up from a land flowing with milk and honey. For Egypt is south of the land of Israel, and one who comes from Egypt to the land of Canaan truly goes up." "<b>That you exercise authority over us.</b> You brought us up from Egypt in order to exercise authority over us." "<b>Also you have made yourself a ruler.</b> Also many dominions, you and your brother."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:17:57.265871549Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}